    "Factory Defaults applied, but some settings couldn't be applied as saved. Presets in nope. shows which, and can undo it.": {
      "comment": "Siri's answer after nope. applied Factory Defaults but, for example, the camera wasn't on. Presets is the name of the list in nope.'s Settings. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Werkseinstellungen angewendet, aber einige Einstellungen konnten nicht wie gesichert angewendet werden. „Presets“ in nope. zeigt, welche, und kann es widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Valores de fábrica aplicados, pero algunos ajustes no se pudieron aplicar tal como se guardaron. Preajustes en nope. muestra cuáles y puede deshacerlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Réglages d’usine appliqués, mais certains réglages n’ont pas pu être appliqués tels qu’enregistrés. Préréglages dans nope. indique lesquels et permet d’annuler."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Impostazioni di fabbrica applicate, ma alcune impostazioni non sono state applicate come salvate. Preimpostazioni in nope. mostra quali e permette di annullare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "工場出荷時の設定を適用しましたが、一部の設定は保存どおりに適用できませんでした。nope. の「プリセット」でどれかを確認し、取り消せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "공장 초기 설정을 적용했지만 일부 설정은 저장된 대로 적용할 수 없었습니다. nope.의 프리셋에서 어떤 설정인지 확인하고 실행 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Fabrieksinstellingen toegepast, maar sommige instellingen konden niet worden toegepast zoals bewaard. Presets in nope. toont welke en kan het herstellen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Padrões de fábrica aplicados, mas alguns ajustes não puderam ser aplicados como salvos. Predefinições no nope. mostra quais e pode desfazer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已应用出厂默认设置，但部分设置未能按存储的方式应用。nope. 中的“预设”会显示是哪些，并可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已套用原廠預設值，但部分設定未能按儲存的方式套用。nope. 中的「預設」會顯示是哪些，並可還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
