    "nope. is still doing an earlier request. Nothing changed.": {
      "comment": "Siri's answer when the request waited too long behind an earlier Siri, Shortcuts or Apple Watch request that nope. was still doing. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. führt noch eine frühere Anfrage aus. Nichts wurde geändert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. sigue con una solicitud anterior. No ha cambiado nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. traite encore une demande précédente. Rien n’a changé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. sta ancora eseguendo una richiesta precedente. Non è cambiato nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope.は前のリクエストをまだ処理中です。何も変更されていません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope.이 아직 이전 요청을 처리하고 있습니다. 변경된 내용이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. is nog bezig met een eerder verzoek. Er is niets gewijzigd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O nope. ainda está fazendo uma solicitação anterior. Nada foi alterado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. 仍在处理之前的请求。未做任何更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. 仍在處理先前的要求。未做任何變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” applied, but some settings couldn't be applied as saved. Presets in nope. shows which, and can undo it.": {
      "comment": "Siri's answer after nope. applied a saved settings preset but, for example, location access is off or the lens doesn't exist on this device. The placeholder is the preset's name, in the language's quotation marks. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "„%@“ angewendet, aber einige Einstellungen konnten nicht wie gesichert angewendet werden. „Presets“ in nope. zeigt, welche, und kann es widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Se ha aplicado «%@», pero algunos ajustes no se pudieron aplicar tal como se guardaron. Preajustes en nope. muestra cuáles y puede deshacerlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "« %@ » appliqué, mais certains réglages n’ont pas pu être appliqués tels qu’enregistrés. Préréglages dans nope. indique lesquels et permet d’annuler."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "«%@» applicata, ma alcune impostazioni non sono state applicate come salvate. Preimpostazioni in nope. mostra quali e permette di annullare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "「%@」を適用しましたが、一部の設定は保存どおりに適用できませんでした。nope. の「プリセット」でどれかを確認し、取り消せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‘%@’을(를) 적용했지만 일부 설정은 저장된 대로 적용할 수 없었습니다. nope.의 프리셋에서 어떤 설정인지 확인하고 실행 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‘%@’ toegepast, maar sommige instellingen konden niet worden toegepast zoals bewaard. Presets in nope. toont welke en kan het herstellen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "“%@” aplicada, mas alguns ajustes não puderam ser aplicados como salvos. Predefinições no nope. mostra quais e pode desfazer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已应用“%@”，但部分设置未能按存储的方式应用。nope. 中的“预设”会显示是哪些，并可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已套用「%@」，但部分設定未能按儲存的方式套用。nope. 中的「預設」會顯示是哪些，並可還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” applied. You can undo it in Presets.": {
      "comment": "Siri's answer after nope. applied a saved settings preset. The placeholder is the preset's name, in the language's quotation marks. Presets is the name of the list in nope.'s Settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "„%@“ angewendet. Du kannst das unter „Presets“ widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
